WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:02.780
Every day, NASA paints the whole planet.

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.320
But millions of people will never see those paintings.

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.280
So Terra Tunes plays them.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:14.940
Hear where the oceans run hot, where storms pour down, and so much more.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.650
Every note comes from a real NASA measurement,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.120
and the Data Deck shows you which one.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.300
Got a NASA picture of your own? Scan it, and it sings too.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.240
Terra Tunes, by team Bit and Beat.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.440
Now everyone can hear the Earth.
